<title>HONG KONG: Tingyi announced first interim results.</title>
<headline>Tingyi announced first interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six month ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	 0.88</p>
<p>Dividend (U.S. cents)  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	6.93 gain</p>
<p>    Net			  35.69</p>
<p>    Turnover		   228.01</p>
<p>    Company name	     Tingyi (Cayman Islands) Holdings Corp</p>
<p>    Books close		N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Tingyi is an instant noodle maker. It was listed on the stock exchange on February 5, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on value added tax compensation and investment grants received.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
